     3,
     "<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">\r\nHi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">I’m trying to get the XML package installed on a computer running Windows XP Pro, but install fails no matter how I try.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Below is the comedy of install errors. All these errors seem to point to the CRAN file being corrupt somehow, which is surprising.  Other packages are installing fine on this machine.  Any thoughts?</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Installing from CRAN:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;overflow:auto;margin:1em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre-wrap;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,255)\">Warning in install.packages :\r\n downloaded length 4276224 != reported length 4288136\r\nWarning in install.packages :\r\n error 1 in extracting from zip file\r\nWarning in install.packages :\r\n cannot open compressed file &#39;XML/DESCRIPTION&#39;, probable reason &#39;No such file or directory&#39;\r\nError in install.packages : cannot open the connection\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Installing from the OmegaHat repo (<code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">install.packages(&quot;XML&quot;, repos = &quot;<a href=\"http://www.omegahat.org/R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.omegahat.org/R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468824184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-pyBdN-KVGVrIqNU__xhz\">http://www.omegahat.org/R</a>&quot;</code>)</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;overflow:auto;margin:1em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre-wrap;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,255)\">package ‘XML’ is available as a source package but not as a binary\r\n\r\nWarning in install.packages :\r\n package ‘XML’ is not available (for R version 3.0.2)\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Downloading and installing the Windows binary from file:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;overflow:auto;margin:1em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid rgb(